  "dek": "Chen’s public score reached 59.17%, while Tufa Labs improved to 56.52% and mtg made a six-point climb into the top three.",
  "discord": "ARC-AGI-3 evening: Yi-Chia Chen took the public lead at 59.17%. Tufa Labs improved to 56.52% in second; mtg climbed to third at 44.32%. NVARC3 stood fifth, and Nhan Duc Nguyen rose into eighth. Public standings remain provisional. Full sourced report: https://arc.markbarney.net/news/2026-10-09-evening-arc-3",
